            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Trigger: The japalisura is targeted by a ranged attack from a bow\n\nThe japalisura attempts to snatch the oncoming arrow from the air, gaining a +4 circumstance bonus to AC against the attack. If the attack misses, the japalisura snatches the arrow and makes a ranged bow Strike to fire the arrow from their own bow."
